            <ArticleTitle>Assessment of Proplast-Teflon disc replacements.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1140-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This retrospective study reports the findings in the follow-up of 31 temporomandibular joints in which Proplast-Teflon (Vitek Inc, Houston, TX) replacements were used. Among the problems noted were pain, malocclusion, restricted opening, and degenerative changes in the condyle and fossa.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
